Warning [jet.MessageText]: The default HTTP body text limit is passed through a lower-level body call
  --> tests/ui_lint/message_text.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     body: req.body().text(1048576) ?? "fallback"
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `request.text()` and `response.text()` already read the body with the same default cap as `body().text(1048576)`
 Fix: Replace `body().text(1048576)` with `text()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0516

